---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../lib/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Analytics & privacy — Michael Dadi"
  description="How this portfolio handles contact messages, operational logs, and Cloudflare Web Analytics."
>
  <section class="page-intro bg-[#f5f5f6]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1000px] px-5 md:px-8">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-5">Updated November 10, 2026</p>
      <h1 class="display">Analytics &amp; privacy.</h1>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[800px] px-5 md:px-8 py-16 prose">
    <h2>Contact messages</h2>
    <p>
      The contact form asks for your name, email address, and message. A server-side service sends
      the message through Resend to my private inbox so I can respond. Your address is used as the
      reply address. Submitting the form does not subscribe you to a mailing list.
    </p>
    <p>
      The website does not maintain a contact-message database. Message content is processed by the
      email provider and stored in the receiving mailbox. Please send only information relevant to
      your inquiry.
    </p>
    <h2>Spam protection</h2>
    <p>
      The form uses Cloudflare Turnstile and approximate request throttling to reduce automated
      abuse. Verification is checked by the server before a message is accepted. If the form is
      unavailable, you can <a href={site.linkedin}>connect with me on LinkedIn</a>.
    </p>
    <h2>Website analytics</h2>
    <p>
      The production site uses Cloudflare Web Analytics to understand visits and page performance.
      Contact-form values are not sent as analytics events or added to page URLs. Analytics is
      disabled on development and preview builds.
    </p>
    <p>
      Read{' '}
      <a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/about/">
        Cloudflare’s explanation of Web Analytics
      </a>{' '}
      and <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">its privacy policy</a> for the
      provider’s processing details.
    </p>
    <h2>Operational information</h2>
    <p>
      Cloudflare hosts this site and processes requests needed to serve it. Application logs record
      operational information such as response categories, timing, and request identifiers. The
      application does not log contact-message bodies, names, email addresses, or verification
      tokens. Provider-level request processing is governed by the providers’ policies.
    </p>
    <h2>Service providers and external links</h2>
    <p>
      The site uses Cloudflare for hosting, verification, and analytics, and Resend for contact
      delivery. GitHub and LinkedIn links take you to those services, where their own policies
      apply. Fonts and portrait assets are served with this site.
    </p>
    <p>
      For a question about a message you submitted, use the <a href="/#contact">contact form</a> or
      LinkedIn. Useful references:{' '}
      <a href="https://resend.com/legal/privacy-policy">Resend privacy policy</a> and{' '}
      <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare privacy policy</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
